Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:03:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 34/40] Add protocol_edges.py; CI: strict shell, pinned
 actions, log artifact

protocol_edges.py covers protocol paths no scenario or table mutant reaches:
restart (seq boundary, cancelled timers, cleared resume), partial guard set
-> need, non-boolean guard and timer event without token -> error, stale vs
current timer token, recovered flag, hello protocol version. Expected replies
written from FORMAT.md section 7 / README rules. Wired into verify-prebuilt.sh.

verify.yml: bash -eo pipefail, permissions read-only, actions pinned by SHA,
verify.sh output kept as an artifact named after the commit.

(cherry picked from commit 53a4ffa56c0013d8b8a010d70491eaf531f8d125)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
